version: 1.5.1
abstract: Reproducibility materials for Separating Backbone and Amide Torsion Effects in N-Methylated
  Fragments and Cyclic Pentaalanines, manuscript v3.4.5. Includes frozen Fourier models, independent
  Ala and retrospective Val validation, acquisition benchmark records, native simulation inputs,
  analysis source, numerical figure data, and the final figure-assembly scripts and supplied manual
  molecular images.
keywords:
- N-methylated cyclic peptides
- torsion correction
- Fourier models
- REST2
- OpenMM
